Wrong (A): Physical security is one element of IT operations but not the central framework concept of ITIL 4.
Wrong (B): The software development lifecycle is addressed by specific practices within ITIL, not the overarching framework concept.
Wrong (D): Financial management of IT is a single ITIL practice, not the central organizing concept of the framework.$EXPL$
